# Infra-global nginx snippet (http context). Intentionally project-agnostic.
#
# Per-project Content-Security-Policy and security headers are rendered into each
# vhost by register-project.sh (see nginx/conf.d/vhost.conf.template). No project-
# specific allow-lists (analytics, fonts, API hosts) live in shared infra anymore;
# set an optional `CSP` variable in the project manifest to customise its policy.
